      "sc:description": "OCTAL (Oxford Cognitive Testing Portal) is a browser-based digital cognitive assessment platform developed at the University of Oxford for remote assessment of aging and dementia, offering an 11-task battery for tablets/computers and a 5-task smartphone version (MiniOCTAL, 23 languages), licensed to researchers with setup, support, data analysis, and normative datasets included.",
